    m_Untranslated: INSTRUCTIONS
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1</b>.  In the <b>Hierarchy</b> window, select the <b>02_Box_Orange</b> GameObject.


      <b>2</b>.  Drag the blue and red handles (the arrowheads) of the <b>Move</b> gizmo to position the smaller orange box close to the larger box.


      <b>3</b>.  Enter Play mode and have the robot collect the second star.


      <b>4</b>.  When you''re finished, exit Play mode and save the scene.'
