  Title:
    m_Untranslated: INSTRUCTIONS
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>1</b>.  Select the <b>Cube</b> GameObject you just added.\n\n<b>2</b>.  Select the <b>Scale</b> tool from the <b>Tool</b> overlay.\n\n<b>3</b>.  Select and drag the handles of the <b>Scale</b> gizmo to change the dimensions of the cube. \n\n<b>4</b>.  Use the <b>Move</b>, <b>Rotate</b>, and <b>Scale</b> tools to change the cube into a ramp to the other platform.\n\n<b>Important</b>: Transforming a cube can be very frustrating, especially when you\u2019re just getting the hang of the <b>Move</b>, <b>Rotate</b>, and <b>Scale</b> tools, but it\u2019s worth testing out your skills.\n\n<b>5</b>.  Enter Play mode and have the robot collect the last star.\n\n<b>6</b>.  When you\u2019re finished, don\u2019t forget to exit Play mode."
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
