    m_Untranslated: "<b>1</b>.  Select the <b>Add (+)</b> button in the upper-left corner of the <b>Hierarchy</b> window.\n\n<b>2</b>.  From the menu, select <b>3D Object</b> > <b>Cube</b>.\n\nA new GameObject named \u201CCube\u201D appears in the <b>Hierarchy</b> window and the <b>Scene</b> view.\n\n<b>3</b>.  Save your scene!\n"
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
