  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "There's one more star to collect in this scene; to reach it, you'll need a ramp. \n\nYou'll start with a simple cube, known as a <b>primitive</b> GameObject. Later, you'll transform that cube into a ramp.\n\nFollow the instructions below to add a primitive cube to your scene. \n"
